        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55398995?u=9f6a9837c9879eceb0abde487a338b92d4e206fc&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41350.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3469848216\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41350/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\">#41350</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #41323.\">Fix</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3462736641\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41323\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41323/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41323\">#41323</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In the spirit of <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3469848216\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41350/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\">#41350</a>, I'm fixing all other cases where we use a variable before defining it, even when it's not technically a bug. However it's not possible to catch all cases, such as the one <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3469848216\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/41350/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/41350\">#41350</a> is reporting about, because it's not a live sample so we don't have the full code.</p>",
