        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 140 adds support for <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/css-values-4/#calc-type-checking\" rel=\"nofollow\">CSS typed arithmetic</a>; see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/4740780497043456\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/4740780497043456</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">It is not very clear what this is from the spec, but <a href=\"https://css-tricks.com/css-typed-arithmetic/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://css-tricks.com/css-typed-arithmetic/</a> provides a good explanation.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR specifically:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Adds a guide under the CSS values and units module explaining what it is, and showing some examples.</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> Adds short sections to the function pages that this new behavior is relevant to (<code class=\"notranslate\">calc()</code>. <code class=\"notranslate\">abs()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">sign()</code> for now, although other functions might be relevant too), and edits any mentions of typed arithmetic rules that are rendered out-of-date by this update.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #40988.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3376705781\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40988\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40988/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40988\">#40988</a></p>\n\n\n\n",
