        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7352080?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the dev-docs-needed request in <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1965975\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1965975</a> Content script event handlers overwriting page's event handlers by documenting the incompatibility between Firefox and Chrome.</p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/41297",
            "title": "Bug-1965975 Content script event handlers overwriting page event handlers",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-30T18:42:17.000Z",
